C145                  0374 *
C145                  0375 *     ROUTINE TO BACKSPACE
C145                  0376 *
C145 CD 0D C1         0377 PBACK    CALL     PLEFT
C148 CD 21 C1         0378          CALL     VDADD      GET SCREEN ADDRESS
C14B 36 20            0379          MVI      M,' '      PUT A BLANK THERE
C14D C9               0380          RET
C14E                  0381 *
