C22C 13               0572          INX      D
C22D 0D               0573          DCR      C          NO MORE THAN TWELVE
C22E C2 26 C2         0574          JNZ      SBLK1
C231 C9               0575          RET      .          GO BACK WITH ZERO FLAG SET
C232                  0576 *
C232                  0577 *
C232                  0578 *  SCAN PAST UP TO 10 BLANK POSITIONS LOOKING FOR
